Subdomain Gradebook of StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation 'An individual assignment in a gradebook is represented as a
                  'GradebookEntry. A GradebookEntry may be mapped to
                  'LearningStandards or a LearningObjective. Each student's score
                  'for that entry is a StudentGradebookEntry which can be a grade
                  'or a CompetencyLevel.
    domain item Course
    domain item LearningObjective
    domain item LearningStandard
    domain item Section
    domain item Student
    domain item StudentGradebookEntry
    domain item StudentSectionAssociation
    position 3

